enderutilities.gui.infoarea.asu=- The stack limit set here is the maximum stack size of the inventory|lf- (Ctrl/Shift +) left/right/middle click or scroll to change the value|lf- Middle click (items in cursor or slot): lock the slot to that item|lf- Alt + middle click: Swap two stacks|lf- Shift + Middle click (in Creative): Fill stack (> 1 item in cursor)|lf  or cycle the stack size in x10 increments (1 item in cursor)
enderutilities.gui.infoarea.barrel=- Right click with a Barrel Label to apply a label to that side|lf- Add a Barrel Structural Upgrade to keep contents when broken|lf- Each Barrel Capacity Upgrade adds %d stacks of capacity|lf- Middle click (items in cursor or slot): lock the slot to that item|lf- Shift + Middle click (in Creative): Fill stack (> 1 item in cursor)|lf  or cycle the stack size in x10 increments (1 item in cursor)|lf- The Barrel can also be (un-)locked with a Storage Key
enderutilities.gui.infoarea.creation_station=Crafting presets:|lf- Left click (1st): Load recipe|lf- Left click (2nd): Add an item to the grid|lf- Left Click (3rd): Fill grid up to largest existing stack|lf- Shift + left click: Store recipe|lf- Right click: Clear grid (same as 'x')|lf- Clear the grid (again) when empty to hide the recipe|lf- Middle click: Remove stored recipe|lf- Shift + click the quick move buttons to set the quick|lf  action, which happens on double-left-click on the block|lf- The crafting grid you last interact with|lf (hilighted) is used for JEI recipe filling
enderutilities.key.togglemode=Toggle Mode
enderutilities.gui.infoarea.drawbridge=- Extends or contracts a line of blocks|lf- The maximum length of the line is adjustable|lf- The delay between operations is adjustable|lf- To use a specific orientation of blocks or blocks|lf  with TileEntity data preserved, build them|lf  in the world and then click "Take block states from world"|lf- For the Normal Drawbridge, the state is taken|lf  from the first block infront of the Drawbridge|lf- Can be camouflaged by right clicking with an|lf  empty main hand, while holding a block in the offhand|lf- Sneak + right click with an empty hand|lf  to remove the camouflage
enderutilities.gui.infoarea.inserter_filtered=- Tries to insert items to the "side outputs" first|lf- If that fails, or they aren't allowed by the filters,|lf   then the items will go out the "normal out" side instead|lf- Input filtering is only for pulling items, other things|lf   could still push non-allowed items into the Inserter|lf- Sneak + right click with an empty hand to change the output sides|lf- The stack limit defines how many items will be moved at once|lf- (Shift and/or Ctrl) left/right/middle click or scroll over|lf   the +/- buttons to change the values
enderutilities.gui.infoarea.inserter_normal=- Tries to insert items to the "side outputs" first|lf- If that fails then the items will go out the "normal out" side instead|lf- Sneak + right click with an empty hand to change the output sides|lf- The stack limit defines how many items will be moved at once|lf- (Shift and/or Ctrl) left/right/middle click or scroll over|lf  the +/- buttons to change the values
